### Get restaurants

GET http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants


### Create restaurant

POST http://localhost:8080/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spice Garden",
  "description": "Authentic Indian cuisine",
  "ownerId": "owner123",
  "address": "Main Road, Chennai",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "rating": 4.5,
  "deliveryTime": 30,
  "priceForTwo": 450,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/spice-garden.jpg",
  "isApproved": true,
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-12T12:00:00"
}